Active feature: **001-portfolio-website** — see the plan at
`specs/001-portfolio-website/plan.md` (spec: `specs/001-portfolio-website/spec.md`).

Key stack: **framework-free static HTML + Tailwind CSS** (no Astro/React/Vue), with
**TypeScript** (strict) for enhancement scripts, typed content modules (`src/data/*.ts`),
and a build-time privacy guard. Build pipeline: **Tailwind CLI + esbuild + posthtml-include**;
deployed to **GitHub Pages** via GitHub Actions (fully static, no backend). Pages: `src/pages/index.html`
+ 3–4 case studies at `src/pages/work/<slug>.html` (relative links, path-agnostic). DRY via HTML
partials (`src/partials/`), typed data modules, and Tailwind `@apply`. Testing: `tsc`,
ESLint/Prettier/Stylelint, `html-validate`, Vitest (data/DOM/privacy-guard), Playwright + axe-core.
Hard constraints: LinkedIn-only contact (no email/phone/address, no form), all client names
anonymized (privacy guard fails build on leaks), no analytics/cookies, downloadable redacted PDF CV.
Content sourced only from `Knowledge/`. See `specs/001-portfolio-website/{research,data-model,quickstart}.md` and `contracts/`.
